Description: Clean-sheet router configuration framework
 Authoritative configuration daemon and interactive CLI with isolated candidate
 journals, independent commit units, recovery and persistence. Ethernet and dummy interfaces
 are applied through the nVyR Netlink daemon. Static routing uses FRR configuration reloads
 with verified recovery and IPv4/IPv6 filtering uses atomic nftables loads.
